    "question": {
      ":question/id": "d4e44972-6527-5b02-b22f-1fd47cd804e6",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\sin(x+180^\\circ)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ or $\\cos x$.\n\n$\\sin(x+180^\\circ)=$ {{field-1}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the sum formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u+v)=\\sin u\\cos v+\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nApply it and substitute the exact special-angle values:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x+180^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 180^\\circ+\\cos x\\sin 180^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)+\\cos x\\cdot\\left(0\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\sin x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
